{
  "borough": "London Borough of Barking and Dagenham",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;The&amp;nbsp;proposed development fails to provide sufficient information with respect to transport, refuse and waste management,&amp;nbsp; and access. In the absence of such, the proposal is likely to significantly impact the accessibility and operation of the site and the surrounding area.&amp;nbsp; The proposal fails to demonstrate safe and adequate car and cycle parking and safe access for pedestrians and cyclists entering the site. The proposal is therefore likely to result in a detrimental impact on highway safety and the existing transport network, to the detriment of sustainable travel principles. It is therefore contrary to the following:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;The National Planning Policy Framework&amp;nbsp;(NPPF) (MHCLG, 2024)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;Policies T3, T5 and T6 of the London Plan (March 2021)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;Policies SP8, DMM1, DMS1, DMSI 8, DMT2 and DMT3 of&amp;nbsp;The London Borough of Barking and Dagenham’s Local Plan 2037: (September 2024)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;",
    "&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;The&amp;nbsp;proposed development would result in the loss of industrial land within an identified Locally Significant Industrial Site. Insufficient detail has been provided to ensure that the retail component of the application would remain ancillary to the industrial use, and would result in the loss of important industrial land. the proposed development is therefore contrary to the following:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;The National Planning Policy Framework&amp;nbsp;(NPPF) (MHCLG, 2024)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;Policies S1, E4, E5, E6, and E7 of the London Plan (March 2021)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;Policies SP2, SP4, and DMS1 of&amp;nbsp;The London Borough of Barking and Dagenham’s Local Plan 2037: (September 2024)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;"
  ],
